The Harrowgate Herald

WELCOME ABOARD
Please welcome Jun Park, who joins the warehouse this month. Stop by and say =
hello, and go easy on the acronyms.

SAFETY CORNER
371 days without a lost-time injury in the warehouse. Reminder: the rolling l=
adders in aisle 9 are tagged out until the new casters arrive.

HOUSEKEEPING
The break-room fridge will be cleaned out Friday at 3 p.m. Anything unlabeled=
 goes. Yes, including the mystery soup.

FROM THE PRESIDENT'S DESK
Thank you all for a strong first quarter. Our fill rate stayed above 97% whil=
e we moved the bulk stainless line to the new racking.

TECH TIP
You can now reset your own password from the login screen. Ted would like to =
never hear the words 'I'm locked out' again.

